WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:00.960
- What's up everybody?

00:00:00.960 --> 00:00:02.400
We're here with Jane Lynch.

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:03.233
Give it up.

00:00:03.233 --> 00:00:04.499
(applause)

00:00:04.499 --> 00:00:05.332
- Hello, hello.

00:00:05.332 --> 00:00:08.979
- Our next guest is a singer,
actor, game show host, author,

00:00:08.979 --> 00:00:12.450
entrepreneur, popcorn
enthusiast, and big brother

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:14.730
to a couple guys you
might know, Nick and Joe.

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:16.819
Give it up for Kevin Jonas, everybody.

00:00:16.819 --> 00:00:18.246
(applause)

00:00:18.246 --> 00:00:20.829
(upbeat music)

00:00:31.428 --> 00:00:32.261
- Yeah.

00:00:32.261 --> 00:00:33.094
- Hello, hello.

00:00:33.094 --> 00:00:33.927
- It's great to see you again.

00:00:33.927 --> 00:00:34.782
Have y'all met before?

00:00:34.782 --> 00:00:35.615
- We have.
- Yeah, we have actually.

00:00:35.615 --> 00:00:36.648
- Yes, we have.

00:00:36.648 --> 00:00:38.490
- Oh, okay, right on.
- Fellow game show hosts.

00:00:38.490 --> 00:00:40.620
- Exactly. It's kind of a camaraderie.

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:41.490
- [Kevin] Friday night dinners-

00:00:41.490 --> 00:00:43.008
- Fraternity sort of thing. Yes.

00:00:43.008 --> 00:00:43.841
(laughs)

00:00:43.841 --> 00:00:45.030
- I wanna come.

00:00:45.030 --> 00:00:48.000
Okay, so we're gonna, we're
gonna talk popcorn in a minute.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:49.140
But first, you and your wife

00:00:49.140 --> 00:00:49.973
have a new kids book coming out.

00:00:49.973 --> 00:00:50.806
- Yes, we do.

00:00:50.806 --> 00:00:51.639
- [Kelly] That's incredible.

00:00:51.639 --> 00:00:52.830
- Yeah, we're really excited. Thank you.

00:00:52.830 --> 00:00:54.441
This is our second
installment of the book.

00:00:54.441 --> 00:00:56.370
You know, "There's a Beach in my Bedroom."

00:00:56.370 --> 00:00:58.350
You know, we're just, it's
all about disappointment

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:00.360
and understanding what it to
do when things have to change.

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:03.611
And in our life, with as much
as our life can change in a-

00:01:03.611 --> 00:01:04.444
(snaps)

00:01:04.444 --> 00:01:05.277
drop of a hat sometimes,

00:01:05.277 --> 00:01:07.110
you're expecting to do one
thing and you have to shift.

00:01:07.110 --> 00:01:08.400
And so this was kind of about that.

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:09.900
- [Kelly] Oh my gosh. Pivoting.

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:10.733
- It's hard,

00:01:10.733 --> 00:01:11.566
- As a parent, too.

00:01:11.566 --> 00:01:12.399
- Woo woo.

00:01:12.399 --> 00:01:13.500
- Lot of bribery.

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:14.910
- Yeah. I have a nine and six
year old, Alena and Valentina.

00:01:14.910 --> 00:01:16.259
Hey, we're not doing this today.

00:01:16.259 --> 00:01:17.790
(deep voice) But you promised.

00:01:17.790 --> 00:01:18.882
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:18.882 --> 00:01:20.160
- (deep voice) You said
I could have ice cream.

00:01:20.160 --> 00:01:20.993
- [Kevin] Yes, exactly.

00:01:20.993 --> 00:01:23.880
But yeah, that, that was before
18 candy bars that you had.

00:01:23.880 --> 00:01:25.969
- Yeah, exactly. Thank you.

00:01:25.969 --> 00:01:28.350
Well, among their many, many ventures

00:01:28.350 --> 00:01:29.970
Kevin and his brothers
have a popcorn line.

00:01:29.970 --> 00:01:30.803
It's incredible.

00:01:30.803 --> 00:01:32.640
It's called Rob's Backstage Popcorn.

00:01:32.640 --> 00:01:33.659
- [Kevin] Oh, I don't know-

00:01:33.659 --> 00:01:34.492
- [Kelly] Last month-

00:01:34.492 --> 00:01:35.580
- [Kevin] You may have your own version.

00:01:35.580 --> 00:01:39.110
- I, I may have my
fantastic, incredible flavor.

00:01:39.110 --> 00:01:39.943
- [Kevin] Ooh.

00:01:39.943 --> 00:01:41.070
- Last month, Nick came by

00:01:41.070 --> 00:01:42.720
to unveil actually, their newest flavor.

00:01:42.720 --> 00:01:44.730
It's called, Kelly's Classic Barbecue.

00:01:44.730 --> 00:01:45.720
It's amazing.

00:01:45.720 --> 00:01:46.689
It's actually addictive.

00:01:46.689 --> 00:01:48.153
I'm sorry and you're welcome.

00:01:48.153 --> 00:01:50.220
You had a contest in connection

00:01:50.220 --> 00:01:51.600
with the flavors released though,

00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:53.370
so, it ended in a tie.

00:01:53.370 --> 00:01:54.203
- It did.

00:01:54.203 --> 00:01:55.099
It's incredible, isn't it?

00:01:55.099 --> 00:01:55.932
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:55.932 --> 00:01:56.765
- Oh, we had two amazing players.

00:01:56.765 --> 00:01:57.840
They, it was a, it was a filter.

00:01:57.840 --> 00:01:59.190
You had to catch popcorn in your mouth

00:01:59.190 --> 00:02:01.860
on, you know, on the, on the Instagrams.

00:02:01.860 --> 00:02:02.693
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:02:02.693 --> 00:02:03.526
- [Kevin] Look at that. Look
at us all playing there.

00:02:03.526 --> 00:02:04.359
- [Kelly] On the 'gram. (laughs)

00:02:04.359 --> 00:02:05.670
- [Kevin] Sadly, we ended in a tie.

00:02:05.670 --> 00:02:06.990
So, what better way to do it

00:02:06.990 --> 00:02:08.730
than have it come to life

00:02:08.730 --> 00:02:09.660
and do it in real life.

00:02:09.660 --> 00:02:11.790
- So we have the two
gentlemen in our audience

00:02:11.790 --> 00:02:13.080
who tied for first.

00:02:13.080 --> 00:02:14.567
So, let's say hello to
Josh and Cam, everybody,

00:02:14.567 --> 00:02:15.400
(applause)

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:16.233
What's up, y'all?

00:02:16.233 --> 00:02:18.074
- [Kevin] Hi Josh. Hi Cam.

00:02:18.074 --> 00:02:21.030
- Do you mind doing this
contest first in tiebreaker?

00:02:21.030 --> 00:02:21.863
Do you mind hosting?

00:02:21.863 --> 00:02:22.851
- I am honored and I'm thrilled.

00:02:22.851 --> 00:02:23.684
(audience cheers)

00:02:23.684 --> 00:02:25.002
- [Kelly] Okay. Okay.

00:02:25.002 --> 00:02:26.250
- Well, Josh and Cam
have spent days training

00:02:26.250 --> 00:02:28.613
in the art of popcorn,
tossing, and catching.

00:02:28.613 --> 00:02:30.840
Why don't, why don't y'all
come down here right now

00:02:30.840 --> 00:02:32.070
Josh and Cam,
(audience applauds)

00:02:32.070 --> 00:02:33.970
so we can get this tiebreaker started.

00:02:35.253 --> 00:02:36.540
- Thank you, America.

00:02:36.540 --> 00:02:38.400
Well, we've broken you into two teams

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:41.010
representing Rob's Backstage Popcorn.

00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:43.650
Kevin and Cam are Team Sweet &amp; Salty.

00:02:43.650 --> 00:02:45.144
Woo. Let's hear for them.

00:02:45.144 --> 00:02:46.110
(audience cheers)

00:02:46.110 --> 00:02:48.840
Kelly and Josh are Team Barbecue.

00:02:48.840 --> 00:02:49.673
- [Kelly] Yes! Yes!

00:02:49.673 --> 00:02:51.120
(audience cheers)

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:53.460
- Now While Kelly and Kevin
are part of the competition

00:02:53.460 --> 00:02:56.192
they have one role and one role only.

00:02:56.192 --> 00:02:58.140
Moral support.

00:02:58.140 --> 00:02:58.973
And that is it.

00:02:58.973 --> 00:03:01.680
They cannot help their
teammates in any other way.

00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:03.120
All right, Cam and Josh.

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:04.230
You will have 30 seconds

00:03:04.230 --> 00:03:06.900
to catch as many kernels as you can.

00:03:06.900 --> 00:03:09.060
One kernel at a time.

00:03:09.060 --> 00:03:11.490
Your hand must go below your face

00:03:11.490 --> 00:03:15.570
and the kernel must be tossed
above your head to count.

00:03:15.570 --> 00:03:17.104
And if we tie again,

00:03:17.104 --> 00:03:19.290
we'll go to Sudden Death.

00:03:19.290 --> 00:03:22.020
All right.

00:03:22.020 --> 00:03:23.790
Kelly and Kevin, you wanna
show them how it's done?

00:03:23.790 --> 00:03:24.623
- [Kelly] Yes.
- [Kevin] Absolutely.

00:03:24.623 --> 00:03:25.680
- I, I need redemption.

00:03:25.680 --> 00:03:26.513
Here you go.

00:03:27.361 --> 00:03:30.090
(everyone cheers and applauds)

00:03:30.090 --> 00:03:30.990
- [Jane] Nice.

00:03:30.990 --> 00:03:31.823
- Oh my god, it's so good.

00:03:31.823 --> 00:03:32.763
- [Jane] Folks, there are official judges

00:03:32.763 --> 00:03:34.740
from Rob's Backstage Popcorn

00:03:34.740 --> 00:03:37.743
standing by to determine
the official winner.

00:03:39.330 --> 00:03:41.187
All right, fellas, Cam and Josh.

00:03:41.187 --> 00:03:42.330
Are you all set?

00:03:42.330 --> 00:03:43.163
- We're ready.

00:03:43.163 --> 00:03:46.091
- All right. Let's get
30 seconds on the clock.

00:03:46.091 --> 00:03:47.310
- [Kelly] (claps) You're gonna do it.

00:03:47.310 --> 00:03:48.305
- [Jane] Go!

00:03:48.305 --> 00:03:50.299
(fast-paced music)

00:03:50.299 --> 00:03:53.132
(audience cheers)

00:03:55.529 --> 00:03:57.952
- [Kelly] (shouts) You're amazing!

00:03:57.952 --> 00:03:59.202
You're amazing!

00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:01.860
He is crushing it!

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:08.583
You are killing it.

00:04:09.531 --> 00:04:10.698
What the hell?

00:04:11.592 --> 00:04:14.259
(Kelly screams)

00:04:17.419 --> 00:04:19.251
(loud horn sounds)

00:04:19.251 --> 00:04:20.181
- Oh my god.

00:04:20.181 --> 00:04:21.014
- Wow!

00:04:22.152 --> 00:04:22.985
- Oh my-

00:04:22.985 --> 00:04:23.818
- Okay.

00:04:23.818 --> 00:04:24.810
(drumroll plays)

00:04:24.810 --> 00:04:25.860
- [Kelly] Wait, what?

00:04:26.730 --> 00:04:27.573
- [Jane] Judges?

00:04:28.722 --> 00:04:29.620
(bell dings)

00:04:29.620 --> 00:04:32.671
(audience cheers)

00:04:32.671 --> 00:04:35.088
- [Jane] Our official winner.

00:04:36.533 --> 00:04:38.970
- Cam and Josh. You guys
really put your all into this.

00:04:38.970 --> 00:04:39.803
And so of course,

00:04:39.803 --> 00:04:42.210
we don't wanna let anyone
leave empty handed.

00:04:42.210 --> 00:04:45.737
So, we're giving you, Josh, $5,000.

00:04:45.737 --> 00:04:47.927
(cheers and whoops)

00:04:47.927 --> 00:04:50.127
- [Kevin] Take that all day. That's right.

00:04:50.127 --> 00:04:54.150
And Cam, say hello to your brand new car.

00:04:55.353 --> 00:04:57.067
(upbeat tempo)

00:04:57.067 --> 00:04:59.900
(audience cheers)

00:05:02.875 --> 00:05:05.359
- [Kelly] That's incredible.

00:05:05.359 --> 00:05:07.146
Thank you so much everybody.

00:05:07.146 --> 00:05:08.827
Keep an eye out for
Kevin in the new season

00:05:08.827 --> 00:05:11.370
of "Claim to Fame" later this year.

00:05:11.370 --> 00:05:13.230
And catch Jane in "Party Down" on Starz

00:05:13.230 --> 00:05:14.063
